(6252329, 924692, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog makes <strike>pilgrimidge</strike> <strike>pilgumedge</strike> <strike>pilghr</strike> long travel to ancestral sacred place. Grog climbs to peak, makes sacrifice of tomatoes and bacon. Grog waits for revelation of greatness. Grog waits more. Grog gets thirsty and hungry, go to nearby Starbucks. Grog wait there. If great old ones want Grog, great old ones will find sticky note to tell where Grog goes.</td>', 'Grog makes pilgrimidge pilgumedge pilghr long travel to ancestral sacred place. Grog climbs to peak, makes sacrifice of tomatoes and bacon. Grog waits for revelation of greatness. Grog waits more. Grog gets thirsty and hungry, go to nearby Starbucks. Grog wait there. If great old ones want Grog, great old ones will find sticky note to tell where Grog goes.', '2010-12-13 00:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6252338, 924670, 83313, '<td valign="top">Instant fave!! How could I not like this shot of Cory in his native habitat? This could be a selfie or could be from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=121986" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">schlake</a>. You might take some dings for the entry itself being from the top down, but really, it''s some creative thinking on the topic. Hope you have the shot that was being taken to show us later.</td>', 'Instant fave!! How could I not like this shot of Cory in his native habitat? This could be a selfie or could be from  schlake. You might take some dings for the entry itself being from the top down, but really, it''s some creative thinking on the topic. Hope you have the shot that was being taken to show us later.', '2010-12-13 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
