(6253164, 924885, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is officially my final five countdown towards my 10,000th comment.  It suddenly acquired enormous portent for me, so I chose the final five from the thumbnails.  This is number 9,998.<br/> <br/>This is an exceptional abstract for me.  I don''t know if it''s the shape of the leaves, the glow of the sky between the leaves, or the stunning silvery-green desaturated color of the leaves, or the incredible range of contrast and tones.  It is a breathtaking pattern, and I could lie on the ground looking up at this all day long.</td>', 'This is officially my final five countdown towards my 10,000th comment.  It suddenly acquired enormous portent for me, so I chose the final five from the thumbnails.  This is number 9,998. This is an exceptional abstract for me.  I don''t know if it''s the shape of the leaves, the glow of the sky between the leaves, or the stunning silvery-green desaturated color of the leaves, or the incredible range of contrast and tones.  It is a breathtaking pattern, and I could lie on the ground looking up at this all day long.', '2010-12-13 20:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253165, 924565, 96751, '<td valign="top">Even though this reminds me of an image from a while ago, this is simply gorgeous.  Strong geometry, marvelous tonal gradients, minimalist content, and the bird soaring about it all.</td>', 'Even though this reminds me of an image from a while ago, this is simply gorgeous.  Strong geometry, marvelous tonal gradients, minimalist content, and the bird soaring about it all.', '2010-12-13 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
