(6253167, 924806, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the repetitive pattern of light dashes down the right side of the image.  It''s hypnotic; I fear I''ll get white line fever if I stare at it too long.</td>', 'I love the repetitive pattern of light dashes down the right side of the image.  It''s hypnotic; I fear I''ll get white line fever if I stare at it too long.', '2010-12-13 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
