(6253176, 924850, 96751, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS solar flare.  This almost looks like it was shot through a polarized glass with a polarizer lens.  Weird and wonderful colors make this plane seem like it''s leaving for a fantasy.</td>', 'FABULOUS solar flare.  This almost looks like it was shot through a polarized glass with a polarizer lens.  Weird and wonderful colors make this plane seem like it''s leaving for a fantasy.', '2010-12-13 21:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
