(6253179, 924799, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea, wonderfully executed.  The b/w conversion is perfect, and even has a slight metallic look to it.  Perhaps the best use of shallow dof in a very long time.  This image is going to land on the front page. Well, mine anyway.<br/> <br/>PS - I had already commented on this before realizing how close I was to my 10,000th comment.  I would certainly have made this one of my final five.</td>', 'Fabulous idea, wonderfully executed.  The b/w conversion is perfect, and even has a slight metallic look to it.  Perhaps the best use of shallow dof in a very long time.  This image is going to land on the front page. Well, mine anyway. PS - I had already commented on this before realizing how close I was to my 10,000th comment.  I would certainly have made this one of my final five.', '2010-12-13 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
