(6253229, 924697, 96751, '<td valign="top">That arch fragment is so powerful and truly makes this image.  Wonderful pp''ing, although the halo in the sky around the building  is a minor nit.</td>', 'That arch fragment is so powerful and truly makes this image.  Wonderful pp''ing, although the halo in the sky around the building  is a minor nit.', '2010-12-13 21:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
