(6253231, 924738, 61084, '<td valign="top">Gonna go out on a limb here and guess that this is the work of NikonJeb. Could be wrong, but hey I like the shot and it''s a good thing.<br/> <br/>Not voting until later in the week.</td>', 'Gonna go out on a limb here and guess that this is the work of NikonJeb. Could be wrong, but hey I like the shot and it''s a good thing. Not voting until later in the week.', '2010-12-13 21:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
