(6253233, 924526, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is officially my final five countdown towards my 10,000th comment.  It suddenly acquired enormous portent for me, so I chose the final five from the thumbnails.  This is number 9,999.<br/> <br/>A real standout in a challenge filled with trees and buildings.  Terrific diagonal composition, with a very strong story.  The jeans and work shirt are a wonderful counterpoint to the bejeweled fingers.  There is a strong journalistic feel here, which the b/w and grain help underscore.  This image inspires an odd mix of emotions - sadness and hope.</td>', 'This is officially my final five countdown towards my 10,000th comment.  It suddenly acquired enormous portent for me, so I chose the final five from the thumbnails.  This is number 9,999. A real standout in a challenge filled with trees and buildings.  Terrific diagonal composition, with a very strong story.  The jeans and work shirt are a wonderful counterpoint to the bejeweled fingers.  There is a strong journalistic feel here, which the b/w and grain help underscore.  This image inspires an odd mix of emotions - sadness and hope.', '2010-12-13 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253234, 924772, 96751, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at, but it inspires a sense of wonder and makes me want to giggle.</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at, but it inspires a sense of wonder and makes me want to giggle.', '2010-12-13 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253235, 924831, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very imposing; just missing a bit of depth in the lighting, and perhaps some more color.  This would also work well in b/w.</td>', 'Very imposing; just missing a bit of depth in the lighting, and perhaps some more color.  This would also work well in b/w.', '2010-12-13 21:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
