(6253663, 924644, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s some visible artifacting around the boom, but I''m probably the only one anal enough to have issue with it. Otherwise an interesting shot of this crane. Just enough tonemapping to give it some nice oomph.</td>', 'There''s some visible artifacting around the boom, but I''m probably the only one anal enough to have issue with it. Otherwise an interesting shot of this crane. Just enough tonemapping to give it some nice oomph.', '2010-12-14 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253667, 924886, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this comes off to me as an average snapshot. It''s a good subject and I think some common adjustments such as levels, color balance, contrast and sharpening could bump it up a notch. A stronger perspective view might also suit it to this challenge topic a little more.</td>', 'I''m afraid this comes off to me as an average snapshot. It''s a good subject and I think some common adjustments such as levels, color balance, contrast and sharpening could bump it up a notch. A stronger perspective view might also suit it to this challenge topic a little more.', '2010-12-14 13:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253668, 924750, 83313, '<td valign="top">My eye is actually led away from the subject, which is the root. Either that or the main subject of the tree is OOF. Somehow, I find that actually works well for this scene. Giving this one a high vote.</td>', 'My eye is actually led away from the subject, which is the root. Either that or the main subject of the tree is OOF. Somehow, I find that actually works well for this scene. Giving this one a high vote.', '2010-12-14 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253681, 924391, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yes, server-of-meals, run to prepare table of honor for Grog''s party! Friends of Grog will eat well tonight at fancy place that Grog cannot pronounce. Grog will sit at table with Thag, Kron and Ugggg to eat and drink and tell stories of hunting and greatness. All is good.<br/> <br/>Grog has question, though. Why is Grog''s table of honor in alley?</td>', 'Yes, server-of-meals, run to prepare table of honor for Grog''s party! Friends of Grog will eat well tonight at fancy place that Grog cannot pronounce. Grog will sit at table with Thag, Kron and Ugggg to eat and drink and tell stories of hunting and greatness. All is good. Grog has question, though. Why is Grog''s table of honor in alley?', '2010-12-14 13:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253691, 924004, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am going to give you the benefit of the doubt that this was actually taken under water. Because if so this is a pretty cool effect. I do wish that you would have cropped out the glaring white on the top, that is very unappealing to me even though I love the rest of the image. Actually, I just realized that most of that is just border. Definitely would have left that out, and isn''t that adding image space and not allowed? I really like the blue and green tones and the wavy trees 5</td>', 'I am going to give you the benefit of the doubt that this was actually taken under water. Because if so this is a pretty cool effect. I do wish that you would have cropped out the glaring white on the top, that is very unappealing to me even though I love the rest of the image. Actually, I just realized that most of that is just border. Definitely would have left that out, and isn''t that adding image space and not allowed? I really like the blue and green tones and the wavy trees 5', '2010-12-14 14:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253696, 924743, 115307, '<td valign="top">Funny! The grain work well here, and the trees (especially between her legs) adds an interesting perspective 8</td>', 'Funny! The grain work well here, and the trees (especially between her legs) adds an interesting perspective 8', '2010-12-14 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253699, 924690, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, I just love this. The lighting is spectacular! A 9 from me and one of my favorites in this challenge so far.</td>', 'Wow, I just love this. The lighting is spectacular! A 9 from me and one of my favorites in this challenge so far.', '2010-12-14 14:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253701, 924366, 115307, '<td valign="top">A truly lovely picture but definitely a DNMC for me. Its not looking up, and the perspective isn''t really all that low either.</td>', 'A truly lovely picture but definitely a DNMC for me. Its not looking up, and the perspective isn''t really all that low either.', '2010-12-14 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253704, 924525, 115307, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing at all. Sorry. It does make the image interesting to look at though. And I do like how it brings out texture in the leather jacket. I I just hate what it does to the faces and the sky</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing at all. Sorry. It does make the image interesting to look at though. And I do like how it brings out texture in the leather jacket. I I just hate what it does to the faces and the sky', '2010-12-14 14:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253708, 924600, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool effect. Reminds me of a fractal. Definitely the coolest pictures of lightposts that I have ever seen</td>', 'This is a pretty cool effect. Reminds me of a fractal. Definitely the coolest pictures of lightposts that I have ever seen', '2010-12-14 14:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253709, 924743, 86305, '<td valign="top">raunchy.</td>', 'raunchy.', '2010-12-14 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6253710, 924750, 115307, '<td valign="top">I keep staring at the tree, expecting it to become sharp any second now.<br/>I appreciate what you were trying to do here, but I really think the entire tree needs to be in focus. This would have gotten top marks from me if it had. Gorgeous gorgeous lighting. 6</td>', 'I keep staring at the tree, expecting it to become sharp any second now.I appreciate what you were trying to do here, but I really think the entire tree needs to be in focus. This would have gotten top marks from me if it had. Gorgeous gorgeous lighting. 6', '2010-12-14 14:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
