(6255419, 924876, 108069, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable symmetry, right down to the washers. There''s some haloing going on where the sky and building meet, and I''m not sure the processing that''s led to that was necessary as I cannot see where it would have really been needed. I think the photo may have been sharper and less grainy without it as well. But no matter, it''s a great image in its own right and a perfect entry to this challenge. Nice one.</td>', 'Unbelievable symmetry, right down to the washers. There''s some haloing going on where the sky and building meet, and I''m not sure the processing that''s led to that was necessary as I cannot see where it would have really been needed. I think the photo may have been sharper and less grainy without it as well. But no matter, it''s a great image in its own right and a perfect entry to this challenge. Nice one.', '2010-12-16 07:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
