(6257646, 924801, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up from an 8 to a 9, and faving it. Just a cool looking subject. I was contacted by someone on Flickr one time regarding a shot of mine that they thought was a tree growing in a silo (It wasn''t, my tree was actually behind it). Apparently trees and plants in general grow quite nicely in old silos, as they are protected from the elements when young. <a href="//www.flickr.com/groups/979274@N20/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here''s the Flickr group</a> if you are interested.</td>', 'Bumping this up from an 8 to a 9, and faving it. Just a cool looking subject. I was contacted by someone on Flickr one time regarding a shot of mine that they thought was a tree growing in a silo (It wasn''t, my tree was actually behind it). Apparently trees and plants in general grow quite nicely in old silos, as they are protected from the elements when young. Here''s the Flickr group if you are interested.', '2010-12-19 19:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
