(6257747, 924162, 18367, '<td valign="top">One should not need to look up...angels are everywhere.  <br/> <br/>Not trying to be overly critical here, but I do have a problem trying to determine what (if any) message you were trying to convey here.<br/> <br/>The lack of composition and focus will (in my opinion) have a very negative impact on your scores.<br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you.</td>', 'One should not need to look up...angels are everywhere.   Not trying to be overly critical here, but I do have a problem trying to determine what (if any) message you were trying to convey here. The lack of composition and focus will (in my opinion) have a very negative impact on your scores. The very best of luck to you.', '2010-12-19 21:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
