(6258027, 924600, 108069, '<td valign="top">I have to say I much prefer this image over the other one, but I''m a sucker for symmetry and simplicity, and a staged throwing of the hat like that would have knocked this down from a 10 to probably a 7, no lie. Other people of course prefer people in the shots so there''s be a bit more emotion, but to me it''s staged and you made the right choice.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon. Was one of the four 10s I dished out in a challenge full of excellent images.</td>', 'I have to say I much prefer this image over the other one, but I''m a sucker for symmetry and simplicity, and a staged throwing of the hat like that would have knocked this down from a 10 to probably a 7, no lie. Other people of course prefer people in the shots so there''s be a bit more emotion, but to me it''s staged and you made the right choice. Congrats on the ribbon. Was one of the four 10s I dished out in a challenge full of excellent images.', '2010-12-20 03:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
