(6258208, 924862, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Removed purple seams"? Are you referring to "purple fringing", a lens aberration where high contrast edges can show color shift?<br/> <br/>IN any event, a lovely image altogether :-) It''s not all that often that the fisheye look comes across so natural and organic. Well done.</td>', '"Removed purple seams"? Are you referring to "purple fringing", a lens aberration where high contrast edges can show color shift? IN any event, a lovely image altogether :-) It''s not all that often that the fisheye look comes across so natural and organic. Well done.', '2010-12-20 11:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258211, 924876, 30861, '<td valign="top">You know what''s strange about this one, to me? The sense of SCALE seems off; the people seem way too large for the size of the panels they are cleaning. I don''t know if anyone else noticed this, but it''s quite bizarre to me :-) <br/> <br/>It''s a lovely image, and (as you''ve realized) it would be lovelier still had you cropped off the anomaly at the bottom.</td>', 'You know what''s strange about this one, to me? The sense of SCALE seems off; the people seem way too large for the size of the panels they are cleaning. I don''t know if anyone else noticed this, but it''s quite bizarre to me :-)  It''s a lovely image, and (as you''ve realized) it would be lovelier still had you cropped off the anomaly at the bottom.', '2010-12-20 11:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258230, 924680, 112972, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your great win, Andrew.  Awesome score!</td>', 'Congratulations on your great win, Andrew.  Awesome score!', '2010-12-20 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258231, 924777, 112972, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon, Chandra!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon, Chandra!', '2010-12-20 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258273, 924612, 76335, '<td valign="top">You''re slipping.</td>', 'You''re slipping.', '2010-12-20 13:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258281, 924891, 76335, '<td valign="top">I tried to find words, I really did. Like posthu, I was thinking charcoal -- or maybe chalk. But it was more about the end than the means. The overall impact bypassed the brain and went right for the gut. I couldn''t call it ominous or sinister, but I couldn''t call it calm or quieting either. Unsettling begins to unravel it, but there''s a lot to unravel, and it''s an understatement at best. To merely call it artistic seemed dismissive. <br/> <br/>Well maybe I did find some words, but none that really get to the heart of the matter. And that''s okay.</td>', 'I tried to find words, I really did. Like posthu, I was thinking charcoal -- or maybe chalk. But it was more about the end than the means. The overall impact bypassed the brain and went right for the gut. I couldn''t call it ominous or sinister, but I couldn''t call it calm or quieting either. Unsettling begins to unravel it, but there''s a lot to unravel, and it''s an understatement at best. To merely call it artistic seemed dismissive.  Well maybe I did find some words, but none that really get to the heart of the matter. And that''s okay.', '2010-12-20 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6258282, 924874, 76335, '<td valign="top">This was a nine from me. Loved it. <br/> <br/>Still shooting with your E-520. How many exposures have you tallied now? For my own purposes, I never cared for the image quality, but the thing is a workhorse.</td>', 'This was a nine from me. Loved it.  Still shooting with your E-520. How many exposures have you tallied now? For my own purposes, I never cared for the image quality, but the thing is a workhorse.', '2010-12-20 13:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
