(6263991, 924879, 60495, '<td valign="top">It may have scored better if you laid between the rails and got the shot as the train approached, it would have been a ribbon shot, probably your last but what a shot it would have been.<br/> <br/>I never looked through this challenge but I would have known it was your train....</td>', 'It may have scored better if you laid between the rails and got the shot as the train approached, it would have been a ribbon shot, probably your last but what a shot it would have been. I never looked through this challenge but I would have known it was your train....', '2010-12-29 15:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6264701, 924393, 7778, '<td valign="top">Love the incredible depth and energy achieved here, notwithstanding the <i>grounded</i> mystery that drives so much of your work. What bothers me is the little offset extension of the flare trail in the upper left of the image. My sense is that the composition could be even more dynamic with the horizon shifted  by corresponding length upward, keeping the eye <i>within</i> the image, instead of beckoning outward...</td>', 'Love the incredible depth and energy achieved here, notwithstanding the grounded mystery that drives so much of your work. What bothers me is the little offset extension of the flare trail in the upper left of the image. My sense is that the composition could be even more dynamic with the horizon shifted  by corresponding length upward, keeping the eye within the image, instead of beckoning outward...', '2010-12-30 13:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6276092, 924826, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg"/></a> O, this is just stunning.  Soft, gentle, and looming in the edge of vision.  Like a loving, but strict parent, when we know we''re doing something wrong.  The zone plate was the perfect choice for the dandelion.</td>', ' O, this is just stunning.  Soft, gentle, and looming in the edge of vision.  Like a loving, but strict parent, when we know we''re doing something wrong.  The zone plate was the perfect choice for the dandelion.', '2011-01-08 07:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6276096, 924891, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg"/></a> An XPrize for you!  I really like this - dark and mysterious, bayou at night.  The depth of tone, the grain, the motion blur, all combine to make this a superb, disturbing, image.</td>', ' An XPrize for you!  I really like this - dark and mysterious, bayou at night.  The depth of tone, the grain, the motion blur, all combine to make this a superb, disturbing, image.', '2011-01-08 07:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
