(6940257, 924569, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>I like this shot for the particular challenge. I think the treatment you gave it is great to bring out all the texture in the tree trunk. I like how that contrasts with the softer, puffy clouds. You definitely have the right viewpoint here. I am not sure if you vignetted this but the clouds look a little dark around the edges. This might have been a bit better if the edges showing the clouds were brighter. Nice shot for the challenge!</td>', 'Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad!  I like this shot for the particular challenge. I think the treatment you gave it is great to bring out all the texture in the tree trunk. I like how that contrasts with the softer, puffy clouds. You definitely have the right viewpoint here. I am not sure if you vignetted this but the clouds look a little dark around the edges. This might have been a bit better if the edges showing the clouds were brighter. Nice shot for the challenge!', '2012-12-22 21:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
